DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/keyless_certificates/{keyless_certificate_id}
Removes a Keyless SSL configuration. SSL connections will no longer use the keyless server for cryptographic operations.
Required: keyless_certificate_id (path); zone_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/keyless_certificates/{keyless_certificate_id}
This will update attributes of a Keyless SSL. Consists of one or more of the following: host,name,port.
Required: keyless_certificate_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/keyless_certificates/{keyless_certificate_id}
Get details for one Keyless SSL configuration.
Required: keyless_certificate_id (path); zone_id (path)
